  "rules": [
    "Do not infer a local occupant response from an unqualified global scalar.",
    "Do not infer MSI, MII or MIF from motion metrics unless the model/method is valid for the exact frequency, posture, exposure and population.",
    "No location, task, failed trial or unknown may be silently dropped.",
    "Emergency egress and safety-critical deck tasks use separate hard approval gates; comfort never substitutes.",
    "A human self-report is an evidence source with protocol/uncertainty, not a calibrated physical measurement.",
    "The ontology is a proposal for benchmark construction, not a comfort or habitability pass."
  ],
